{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c013271a5763a038da6870845e55d908e98f5eaba7c435b065fb598fdf6c58f9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dc979155eae682cf8206a994a318868c1a91fd7e9ed95290cbd3c9d32678f28",
      "text": "打造“难以忘怀”生日的方法",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2928955d9c03751c55dea9564fc9bc563e671293c9766c0080df1f433b59a92",
      "text": "幸广的生日马上就要到了。\n咲等人商量着今年办个怎样的派对。\n但是，幸广去年却忘记了自己的生日。\n既然这样，卷绪想出了一个绝妙的点子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0f598fd93164a3f66d19862aeaf8788dd3396a791b3c8c7e9c95d5f3d0b1de",
      "text": "神谷的生日派对准备得\n超级完美呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a015d90eea081cb479d18997c5f03e1b4905405bc140510566a292cd693246d4",
      "text": "神谷看起来也相当期待\n这场派对呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee4ba7aba0a3c1f54cff6d69f52520e456d3b396a213e33743a7b0e827872ee7",
      "text": "唔姆。神谷身上洋溢出的愉悦旋律。\n吾亦切身感受到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f10b6f6f727311131819ba8a72e98038de90984aa4ebc6eb5d7ac3549d4c375",
      "text": "呵呵呵……没想到他竟然会\n彻底落入吾等的术中！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d8c6091daee53e1c287701768244490dd75d71fe3e391704808fa5518c6217",
      "text": "等●●●●プロデューサー来了之后，\n大家就一起去Cafe Parade吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:677c1332ad193d4458272b8cf378660fcfe3eb99f7f62b2a355e33033293e8c2",
      "text": "嗯！\n啪噼兴奋期待♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c1984a8eab63d35eb8389884db4df25f00af948269ac299c3ce86824f13875",
      "text": "感谢你们一直以来的陪伴。\n每天都过得很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b67866903500f13a6807bf10d71ae4a8aa188e098fbf9a800d07263748eaf72",
      "text": "虽然去年也这么想过，但像这样\n被大家庆祝生日也是件美好的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c7df5bec2cbf291a6a917028d89d97a72e4497f6fe1ee7d11a7c5cffd7f84bd",
      "text": "能留在神谷的记忆里就再好不过了。\n这样一来，明年就不会忘记了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c5feab43d55124f3ecf9f00e58d40b89c6a3813853ce0e81945fa1c28642b81",
      "text": "是啊。一到这个时期，\n我就会想起来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e5caa70bf94183d3e310b721aa0c5fbec8f0c45975d0d48e32f0063339ab68f",
      "text": "呵呵，那真是太好了。\n明年也请好好期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ead858420bf31a7e5ed99d86273d83c24964cc0f86ba10169a75f7d60fc7bdf",
      "text": "真没想到，连撒旦都给我\n写了留言。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:368bf64b0d4c0d81aeaade56088182dfae0f1f4581b15fbec29d242fd6176b33",
      "text": "从降临历里看到留言的时候，\n虽然稍微有些惊讶，但真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c0b1edb77a26db40797510c5062abb87be937568ae1a6578939f4e8c39cc73d",
      "text": "谢谢你，撒旦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd162d05c005626f59f22dcb434e4646e3b1aa3ce7ac21e2085b6bb8ed09e08b",
      "text": "为神谷送上祝福的心意，纵使撒旦亦别无二致。\n吾不过是代为执笔罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d03e3ecd1dd259a3cd165bd7e51e5e0af5c7312f48b53a47ff9a3173a04c555",
      "text": "今宵便向在暗夜中诞生的同胞，\n高高举起祝贺之杯吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:000b166d52fb8ea32bb47c59cc238549c9f2a65599a25e6c0daa81fb09147b81",
      "text": "多亏了卷绪的点子，\n直到生日当天我都过得非常愉快哦。谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bbec484ca61be64444a3bfeae5f035b494803a5f16f4fe394220a88765056b4",
      "text": "能听您这么说，\n我也很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7afb9f225ee92c0f715dd98b5cfacddfd6ae4357b5e964899fe0aa12500d48d5",
      "text": "因为想让神谷先生每天都开开心心的，\n大家一起考虑了很多呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49b6a5a5c5bc3d0dd83c2a1cc7b51216a6aa5aec5e67adcf3169953fbf14b8e2",
      "text": "嗯。能感受到大家心意的、\n非常棒的降临历哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:470183380dfc874504bcb0c318fea2eeb2112fa971b030c4b94798f241c80301",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n今后我也会好好珍惜它的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0840009d754800c16d83de3aaf8e1eba2e6099302bc67615562db258c23ea34a",
      "text": "咲。和留言放在一起的那些茶，\n每一款都非常好喝哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37cdf93ad12e3cfd4b2545011739bd1acc41a10de135e70edc8592a9d08ccf88",
      "text": "喝了那些茶的日子，\n遇到了很多好事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:297c15ffae3f9961d3ffd2a7daff13d1ba813a436d68edef363c927fca4eae81",
      "text": "真的吗！？\n那就太好啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30dc455fe1ad742df914b2c2fba12ff8d11e3225790c27577010bc0a935ef28c",
      "text": "因为那是为了让神谷能度过啪噼开心的一天\n而特意挑选的茶，能听到你这么说真开心～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_027yuk_2_1_2_027_12:1_2_027_12_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f6bc8079f4ef558b4a095aaa66dc3bc0c0bf2d0838c980e6fc7494a661c5e8a",
      "text": "今天派对上的红茶也准备了特别的品种，\n要是能遇到好事就好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
